            Call 089 834 0982
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container max-w-4xl">
      <section class="mb-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Why choose our dryer repair service in Sofia?</h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-indigo-500 mx-auto"></div>
        </div>
