          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-red-500">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Noise or vibration</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Mechanical checks and balancing to remove abnormal sounds and shaking.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-16 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 text-center">Service in all Sofia districts</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
