  <!-- SEO Content Section -->
  <div class="rotorem-seo-text">
    <div class="container max-w-4xl">
      <p dir="ltr">Is your dryer not drying well, not heating, or stopping in the middle of a cycle? These are common issues that require quick intervention, especially when you rely on the appliance every day. At RotoRem, we provide in-home dryer repair in Sofia with on-site diagnostics and effective solutions during the visit whenever possible. We work across the whole city and nearby areas, without the need to transport your appliance to a workshop.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">What dryer problems we repair in Sofia</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">In our practice as a dryer service in Sofia, we resolve a wide range of faults that prevent normal operation. We often receive requests for dryers that do not heat, vibrate excessively, or fail to dry clothes properly.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">Problems can be related to the heater, thermostat, sensors, or electronic control module. Heat pump models can also develop specific faults that require experienced diagnostics and correct repair methods.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">Besides in-home dryer repair, we also provide heat-pump dryer installation and standard installation for new appliances. If space is limited, we also offer stacked installation on top of a washing machine with proper leveling and stable fixing.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">If you also need help with other appliances, you can check our <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/services/sofia/washing-machine-repair/" style="text-decoration:none;">washing machine repair</a> and <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/services/sofia/dishwasher-repair/" style="text-decoration:none;">dishwasher repair</a> services, plus all options on our <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/services/sofia/" style="text-decoration:none;">Sofia white goods repair page</a>.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">Dryer brands we service</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">We repair dryers from all major brands on the market. We work with Bosch, Whirlpool, Samsung, LG, Beko, AEG, and other manufacturers, including modern heat-pump models. We know the technologies and model specifics well, which allows accurate diagnostics and durable repair results.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">Sofia areas we cover</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">We provide diagnostics, installation, and in-home dryer repair across Sofia and nearby areas. We service districts such as Lyulin, Mladost, Nadezhda, Druzhba, Studentski Grad, Manastirski Livadi, Boyana, Lozenets, City Center, as well as locations up to around 20 km outside Sofia. Our goal is fast response, wherever you are.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">How dryer repair works</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">The process starts with an on-site visit and diagnostics to identify the exact cause of the issue. We then provide a clear quote before any work begins. Once approved, we carry out the repair on-site and finish with testing to confirm safe and normal operation.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">For new appliances, we provide dryer installation adapted to your home conditions. Installation includes correct connection, leveling, and operation checks to prevent future issues.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">Why choose RotoRem dryer service in Sofia</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">Customers choose us because they get a real solution, not a temporary fix. We work directly at your address, saving time and effort. Every repair is done with attention to detail and includes service warranty. With years of experience across many brands and models, we can react quickly and correctly. <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/contact/" style="text-decoration:none;">Contact us</a> to book a convenient appointment.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>


